## Install

```bash
npm install --save lib-documentation
```

## API

[https://pob-harness.github.io/lib-documentation/](https://pob-harness.github.io/lib-documentation/)

## Usage

```js
import libDocumentation from "lib-documentation";

console.log(libDocumentation);
```
